1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,593
Crick summed up what DNA is for in his central dogma.

2
00:00:03,593 --> 00:00:06,783
DNA copies itself by replication.

3
00:00:06,783 --> 00:00:09,036
It is transcribed into RNA.

4
00:00:09,036 --> 00:00:12,187
And RNA is translated into protein.

5
00:00:12,187 --> 00:00:19,296
In retroviruses like H I V, reverse transcriptase even copies RNA back into DNA.

